 data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2533\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=OKoobr0gp7g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Le recrutement \u00e0 distance permet aux entreprises de d\u00e9passer les fronti\u00e8res<\/a> traditionnelles du talent, tout en constituant des \u00e9quipes distribu\u00e9es hautement qualifi\u00e9es.<\/p><p data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2791\">Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son r\u00e9seau en Maurice, Madagascar, Kenya, Rwanda, Maroc, Tunisie, C\u00f4te d\u2019Ivoire, S\u00e9n\u00e9gal et Cameroun, Breedj permet aux entreprises d\u2019acc\u00e9der \u00e0 des architectes IA capables de travailler en environnement international, en anglais et en fran\u00e7ais.<\/p><h2 data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2860\">Comp\u00e9tences, qualifications et atouts des talents africains<\/h2><h3 data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2893\">Comp\u00e9tences techniques cl\u00e9s<\/h3><p data-start=\"2894\" data-end=\"2969\">Les architectes IA africains s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9s par Breedj ma\u00eetrisent notamment :<\/p><ul data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3238\"><li data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3012\"><p data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"3012\">Architectures cloud (AWS, Azure, GCP)<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3075\"><p data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3075\">Data engineering et pipelines (ETL, streaming, data lakes)<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3076\" data-end=\"3102\"><p data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3102\">Frameworks ML et MLOps<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3155\"><p data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3155\">APIs, microservices et architectures distribu\u00e9es<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3194\"><p data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3194\">S\u00e9curit\u00e9 des donn\u00e9es et conformit\u00e9<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3238\"><p data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3238\">Int\u00e9gration IA dans des syst\u00e8mes legacy<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3 data-start=\"3240\" data-end=\"3271\">Soft skills diff\u00e9renciantes<\/h3><ul data-start=\"3272\" data-end=\"3501\"><li data-start=\"3272\" data-end=\"3321\"><p data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3321\">Forte capacit\u00e9 d\u2019abstraction et de conception<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3358\"><p data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3358\">Autonomie et culture du delivery<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3398\"><p data-start=\"3361\" data-end=\"3398\">Excellente communication \u00e0 distance<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3449\"><p data-start=\"3401\" data-end=\"3449\">Habitude du travail en \u00e9quipes internationales<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3450\" data-end=\"3501\"><p data-start=\"3452\" data-end=\"3501\">Sensibilit\u00e9 aux enjeux \u00e9thiques et responsables<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"3503\" data-end=\"3673\">Breedj attache une importance particuli\u00e8re \u00e0 la validation des comp\u00e9tences techniques et comportementales, garantissant ainsi des profils imm\u00e9diatement op\u00e9rationnels.<\/p><h2 data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3727\">Co\u00fbts, r\u00e9mun\u00e9ration et avantages \u00e9conomiques<\/h2><p data-start=\"3729\" data-end=\"3834\">Sans entrer dans des chiffres pr\u00e9cis, recruter un architecte IA en Afrique pr\u00e9sente plusieurs avantages :<\/p><ul data-start=\"3836\" data-end=\"4069\"><li data-start=\"3836\" data-end=\"3902\"><p data-start=\"3838\" data-end=\"3902\">Co\u00fbt global inf\u00e9rieur aux march\u00e9s europ\u00e9ens ou nord-am\u00e9ricains<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3903\" data-end=\"3949\"><p data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3949\">Excellent ratio expertise \/ investissement<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"4002\"><p data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"4002\">Flexibilit\u00e9 contractuelle (long terme ou projet)<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"4003\" data-end=\"4069\"><p data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4069\">Fid\u00e9lisation accrue gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des conditions locales attractives<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"4071\" data-end=\"4245\">Breedj s\u2019inscri