prises<\/h3><ul data-start=\"4355\" data-end=\"4540\"><li data-start=\"4355\" data-end=\"4396\"><p data-start=\"4357\" data-end=\"4396\">Raret\u00e9 des profils r\u00e9ellement seniors<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"4397\" data-end=\"4448\"><p data-start=\"4399\" data-end=\"4448\">Difficult\u00e9 d\u2019\u00e9valuer les comp\u00e9tences \u00e0 distance<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"4449\" data-end=\"4490\"><p data-start=\"4451\" data-end=\"4490\">Complexit\u00e9 juridique et contractuelle<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"4491\" data-end=\"4540\"><p data-start=\"4493\" data-end=\"4540\">Gestion de la paie et de la conformit\u00e9 locale<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3 data-start=\"4542\" data-end=\"4563\">R\u00e9ponse de Breedj<\/h3><ul data-start=\"4564\" data-end=\"4799\"><li data-start=\"4564\" data-end=\"4610\"><p data-start=\"4566\" data-end=\"4610\">Sourcing cibl\u00e9 et pr\u00e9qualification avanc\u00e9e<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"4611\" data-end=\"4647\"><p data-start=\"4613\" data-end=\"4647\">\u00c9valuation technique approfondie<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"4648\" data-end=\"4702\"><p data-start=\"4650\" data-end=\"4702\">Employer of Record (EOR) dans 9 pays africains<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4769\"><p data-start=\"4705\" data-end=\"4769\">Gestion compl\u00e8te des contrats, salaires et obligations l\u00e9gales<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"4770\" data-end=\"4799\"><p data-start=\"4772\" data-end=\"4799\">Accompagnement RH continu<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"4801\" data-end=\"4897\">Avec Breedj, les entreprises peuvent recruter sans cr\u00e9er d\u2019entit\u00e9 locale, en toute s\u00e9curit\u00e9.<\/p><h2 data-start=\"4904\" data-end=\"4952\">Comment recruter un architecte IA avec Breedj<\/h2><h3 data-start=\"4954\" data-end=\"4974\">Mod\u00e8les propos\u00e9s<\/h3><ul data-start=\"4975\" data-end=\"5149\"><li data-start=\"4975\" data-end=\"5026\"><p data-start=\"4977\" data-end=\"5026\">EOR pour des postes strat\u00e9giques long terme<\/p><\/li><li data-start